{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"barracks","model_identifier":"barracks","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# barracks\n\nBarracks: a long building, stone ground storey and timber upper storey, weapon racks outside and a practice yard with straw targets and a wooden practice post.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a long hall of dark-stained timber on a cobble footing under a grey shingle roof, with a watch tower and bell at its left end and a stone chimney at its right. Its signature is the facade lined with round player-colour shields above lit shuttered windows; in front, a fenced sand training yard with straw dummies, archery butts, weapon racks and more shields on the fence.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 10 columns (224 x 160 units, 6.30 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -105..105, y 0..150, z -80..75 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 578, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barracks: 160 x 176 x 64 centred at x -16, z 40\n- practice yard: fence ring 204 x 16 x 60 at z -46 (walk-through)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (4, 0, -6)\n- `fx_smoke` at (89, 142, 36)\n- `slot_rally` at (60, 0, -46)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-85, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-78, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-56, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-42, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-28, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (38, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (52, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_6` at (66, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_10` at (82.2, 49, 17)\n- `fx_window_11` at (82.2, 49, 55)\n- `fx_window_12` at (-51, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_13` at (-21, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_14` at (9, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_15` at (39, 33, 68.8)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"cobble_plinth_back#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-69,0,62],"to":[81,12,67],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[308,317,458,329],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[420,330,425,342],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[458,317,608,329],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[425,330,430,342],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[490,433,640,438],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[640,433,790,438],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"cf971d3e-48db-d21d-b730-7c134d8225bd"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_left#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-69.12,-0.12,5],"to":[-60,12.12,63],"autouv":0,"color":5,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[272,330,281,342],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[852,317,910,329],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[281,330,290,342],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[910,317,968,329],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[348,84,357,142],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[357,84,366,142],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ceacb56b-64b1-7306-0804-0c350613279f"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_right#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[72,-0.12,5],"to":[81.24,12.12,63],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[290,330,299,342],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,330,58,342],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[299,330,308,342],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[58,330,116,342],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[366,84,375,142],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[375,84,384,142],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0e75640b-a2ec-9741-92bf-6d962666bae4"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_front_l#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_model